project moved to github.com/nibzard/zodiac. The autoresearch
tree arrives separately in the subtree merge that follows, so
this commit holds only the top-level notes and the demo.

## Gotchas
- .claude/ is gitignored: it holds local ralph-loop session
  state, not project content.
- zodiac-demo/.impeccable/ is tool cache, also gitignored.
